# Dependencies
node_modules
.pnp
.pnp.js

# One package manager only: npm. CI runs `npm ci`, which requires
# package-lock.json. A tracked yarn.lock sat next to it for months resolving a
# different dependency tree, leaving it ambiguous which one a given build would
# honour. Ignored rather than merely deleted so a stray `yarn install` cannot
# reintroduce the ambiguity.
yarn.lock
pnpm-lock.yaml
bun.lockb

